listing:   the kernel image k.bin
toolchain: QEMU emulator version 8.2.2 (Debian 1:8.2.2+ds-0ubuntu1.18)
command:   qemu-system-aarch64 -M virt -cpu cortex-a53 -m 256M -nographic -semihosting -device virtio-rng-device -kernel k.bin
date:      2026-10-09T22:21:55Z
machine:   Linux x86_64 (cloud build container)
exit code: 0
note:      exit code 0 = the kernel powered the machine off through PSCI SYSTEM_OFF
note:      the two RTC readings (seconds since 1970, different on every run) are replaced by <t> and <t+1>; the check on them is the printed word 'ticking'
hardware:  untested on hardware; run in QEMU (qemu-system-aarch64), not on a real board
